Input Structure
    q (number of operations)

Operations:
    INSERT pos text
    DELETE pos length
    FORMAT pos length bold italic   (1/0 flags)
    UNDO
    REDO
    PRINT

Sample Input
    8
    INSERT 0 Hello
    INSERT 5  World
    PRINT
    FORMAT 0 5 1 0
    PRINT
    UNDO
    PRINT
    REDO
    PRINT

Sample Output
    Hello World
    <b>Hello</b> World
    Hello World
    <b>Hello</b> World